  "notes": "Item 19 discloses two tables: (1) Average Gross Yearly Sales (annual) and (2) Average Monthly Active Students (monthly) for franchised Learning Centers (2021, 2022, 2023) and Studio Centers (2023 only). Each table segments data by Overall and six performance quartile subgroups. Cohort eligibility: outlets open and operational at least 12 months before the calendar year start date, excluding those that opened or closed during the year. The cohort_name for 'Overall' rows was set to 'open_12_24mo' as the closest match to the stated 12-month minimum eligibility criterion; note this is an approximation since some outlets may have been open longer. Performance sub-groups are ranked by yearly gross sales. Costs are not included. Data is unaudited. Studio Center data only available for 2023. The 'pct_above_avg' field is derived from the 'Centers Meeting or Exceeding Average' column (e.g., '69 / 39%' yields 39)."
